        "text": "**Developing Encryption Strategy**\n\nI've just finished the skeleton of the `envelope_encrypt.py` file. It's using `google.cloud.kms_v1` as the KMS provider. I've placed a placeholder for the actual encryption of the data and added comments explaining where to put the working encryption algorithm. I need to make sure the data encryption is robust and secure.\n\n\n**Refining Encryption Algorithm**\n\nI've got the `envelope_encrypt.py` file built, leveraging `google.cloud.kms_v1`. Currently, there's a placeholder for the actual data encryption, but I've added clear comments on where to insert the robust algorithm. The example usage in the `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` block is ready, with placeholders for GCP credentials and data input. My next task is to finalize the secure data encryption method.\n\n\n",
